<title>HONG KONG: HK to release 98.76 ha of land in April-June -govt.</title>
<headline>HK to release 98.76 ha of land in April-June -govt.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sino-British Land Commission agreed that the land disposal programme for the period from April 1 to June 30 should amount to 98.76 hectares, the Hong Kong government said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
